            <ArticleTitle>Draft Genome Sequence of Hypervirulent and Vaccine Candidate Streptococcus suis Strain SC19.</ArticleTitle>
            <ELocationID EIdType="pii" ValidYN="Y">e01484-16</ELocationID>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1128/genomeA.01484-16</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Streptococcus suis, a zoonotic bacterium found primarily in pigs, has been recognized recently as an emerging pathogen of humans. Herein, we describe the genome of Streptococcus suis strain SC19, a hypervirulent and vaccine candidate strain isolated from a pig amid the 2005 outbreak in China.</AbstractText>
                <CopyrightInformation>Copyright © 2017 Teng et al.</CopyrightInformation>
            </Abstract>
